                                "sense_id": "8d7344f9-2148-3bd2-85d9-93fdb6da55c9",
                                "text": "It would be easy to draw a popular conclusion that this backhandedness of the language proves the backwardness of their civilization, and the fact that the Turk ought to go way back and sit down in remote Asia"
