                                "sense_id": "a56c558b-8bd0-32f7-9b6d-b29e74670c59",
                                "text": "Russell's clandestine attempt to initiate diplomatic contact with the Confederacy left an image of backhandedness that substantiated Seward's direst premonitions about British self-interest."
